SUMMARY:133rd Anniversary of Calvary Baptist Church
DESCRIPTION:Join Calvary Baptist Church as we celebrate our 133rd Church Anniversary with a special service. Come worship with us as we give thanks for our church family\, reflect on our founding commitment to our community\, and look forward to the future providing practical care to our neighbours. Everyone is warmly invited to join us for this special celebration. Parking off Benlamond Ave.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/133rd-anniversary-of-calvary-baptist-church/
LOCATION:Calvary Baptist Church\, 72 Main St.\, Toronto
