SUMMARY:Run Myles Ahead 5km Fun Run/Walk
DESCRIPTION:Run Myles Ahead 5km Fun Run/Walk at the Leuty Pavillion on the boardwalk\, 11 a.m. A youth fair\, open from 10 a.m.\, includes crafts\, baked goods\, a kids’ lemonade and jokes stand\, and a collective art activity. Visit mylesahead.ca for registration and donation info.
